          "complexTypes": [],
          "type": "boolean | undefined"
        },
        {
          "name": "origins",
          "tags": [],
          "docs": "Allowed request origins. Defaults to `['*']` (any origin).\n\nWhen `allowCredentials` is `true` and `origins` is left at the default\n`['*']`, the server reflects back whatever `Origin` header the request\nsent (browsers reject a literal `*` alongside credentials), which is\nequivalent to allowing *any* website to make credentialed requests.\nAlways set an explicit allowlist here when `allowCredentials` is `true`.",
          "complexTypes": [],
          "type": "string[] | undefined"
        },
        {
          "name": "methods",
          "tags": [],
          "docs": "",
          "complexTypes": [
            "RestMethod"
          ],
          "type": "RestMethod[] | undefined"
        },
        {
          "name": "headers",
          "tags": [],
